-Publishes a workflow event.
-
-**Parameters:**
-- `event`: The event to publish
-
-**Example:**
-```typescript
-const publisher = new EventPublisher(eventBus);
-publisher.publish({
-  type: "workflow.started",
-  instanceId: "instance-1",
-  timestamp: new Date(),
-  data: { workflowId: "workflow-1" }
-});
-```
